---
# Test code keeps the project's curated set except for the checks whose noise is specific to test idioms.
#
# `bugprone-unchecked-optional-access`: 5 firings in RenderGraphBuilderTest.cpp, all on values a preceding
# CHECK/REQUIRE has already established - the old borrowed config excluded it for the same reason ("too many
# false positives in tests"). Production code keeps the check; this directory turns it off.
#
# InheritParentConfig keeps every other check and option from the repository root in sync.
InheritParentConfig: true
Checks: '-bugprone-unchecked-optional-access'
